# DevSecOps credential PROVIDED for Task 4 (hardening).
# This is NOT the credential leaked in Task 2 - this is a separate MinIO
# account, only permitted to edit bucket policy / enable versioning on the 2 lab
# buckets (not root, cannot read data outside this scope).
